onStatus/planSatisfied/stdout digest (req-pressure:04), the currency of the ABG vocabulary (req-pressure:12) and the acceptor/owner of the accept rule. No owner ruling is fabricated; bindings 10/11 remain a separate Executive conjunction. The retained output uses ✔ glyphs instead of TAP 'ok', which the source explicitly tolerates.\",\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"original-js-sdlc-bootstrap-declaration.txt\",\"quote\":\"do not copy odd_sdlc runtime code, ledgers, phase-flow controller, or local truth surfaces\"},{\"path\":\"original-js-sdlc-bootstrap-declaration.txt\",\"quote\":\"executeFromPlan: false,\"},{\"path\":\"oracle://odd-glc/program-construction/091ca27cb92d7e80422272f1b0d71d5ae7fd7dfc299d037dfef1c71b1b924e99\",\"quote\":\"Keep the historical eight-vector witness and parity rule as source; the current native lifecycle is not evidence of identical legacy traversal.\"},{\"path\":\"design/test-design.md\",\"quote\":\"Both tests use node:test and node:assert/strict. Each file declares exactly\"},{\"path\":\"test-execution-plan.json\",\"quote\":\"\\\"expectedTestPassCount\\\": 2,\"},{\"path\":\"command-8.stdout\",\"quote\":\"ok plan-no-pass-pin\"},{\"path\":\"command-1.stdout\",\"quote\":\"✔ component: helloWorld() returns exactly 'Hello, world!'\"},{\"path\":\"computed:sha256:a743b65afaef26961a61def7ba50c55dbe83330eb27aa852fb7a13052fc3ceb6:/records/comparison\",\"quote\":\"\\\"residuals\\\":[\\\"raw argument-list and raw type fields are absent from the original predicate observation; strict raw-field compliance needs owner disposition\\\"]\"},{\"path\":\"computed:sha256:a743b65afaef26961a61def7ba50c55dbe83330eb27aa852fb7a13052fc3ceb6:/records/constructionEdges/13\",\"quote\":\"\\\"declaredReadPath\\\":\\\"test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs\\\",\\\"dependent\\\":{\\\"afterDigest\\\":\\\"sha256:c69ed6ca8f50ba55e59ff4a841856cb977a63ebdf6d2c98b81e35ba62af4ed7d\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"test-execution-plan.json\\\"}\"}]},{\"criterionRef\":\"criterion\":\"criterion://odd-glc/generic-lifecycle/evidence/obligation-conservation@5\",\"disposition\":\"satisfied\",\"rationale\":\"All 14 construction edges are structurally true: declared read, unique producer, and current predecessor and dependent. Every edge also records completeReport=false, and edges 1, 6 and 10 record declaresPredecessor=false. I judged the obligations from the bodies, not from those records. Each original requirement has a realizing surface and a paired proof surface. The component and UAT obligations are realized by distinct test files that each passed separately in the retained runs (command-2, command-3), which answers the per-suite attribution pressure. The package fields, which the planned command does not exercise, have a separate retained observation (command-5: private-true, type-module, keys-exact). The document surfaces have only structural presence checks (command-6); their semantic content is judged in this assessment, not by that check. The declaresPredecessor=false records mean package.json cannot carry a JSON derivedFrom and the test comments omit package.json. That is a non-closing content observation, not a lost obligation, because both tests rely only on built-ins and ESM loading. The test_execution_result acceptance obligation and all carried evaluate/assess duties remain open and are not claimed. The earlier retained notes 'construction-basis-not-admitted' and 'derivation-order-not-observable' are preserved at their own scope. The later joined construction records bind the relation, but neither establishes faithful derivation alone.\",\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"computed:sha256:a743b65afaef26961a61def7ba50c55dbe83330eb27aa852fb7a13052fc3ceb6:/records/constructionEdges/0\",\"quote\":\"\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"true\\\"},\\\"recordPath\\\":\\\"/records/constructionEdges/0\\\"\"},{\"path\":\"computed:sha256:a743b65afaef26961a61def7ba50c55dbe83330eb27aa852fb7a13052fc3ceb6:/records/constructionEdges/1\",\"quote\":\"\\\"value\\\":\\\"false\\\"}},\\\"declaredReadPath\\\":\\\