t bytes: the planned run passed 2 with 0 failures, each suite passed separately, the verifier scripts exited 0, and the module return value observed was \\\"Hello, world!\\\". Remaining obligations are open: the owner conjunction for bindings 10/11 and the test_execution_result acceptance, every carried evaluate/assess duty (state missing), and the raw-field disposition. Neither the candidates nor the author report claim release, application closure or original-task closure, and this assessment claims none. Test counts, file presence and structural true records are not treated as acceptance.\",\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"specification/project-conformance.md\",\"quote\":\"The test execution result has no authored file;\"},{\"path\":\"design/implementation-design.md\",\"quote\":\"The execution result has no file. It is realized only by admitted native\"},{\"path\":\"test-execution-plan.json\",\"quote\":\"\\\"expectedTestPassCount\\\": 2,\"},{\"path\":\"original-js-sdlc-bootstrap-declaration.txt\",\"quote\":\"Judge the observed executionStatus, planSatisfied flag, observedTestPassCount, and stdout digest against the prior test_execution_plan.\"},{\"path\":\"command-1.stdout\",\"quote\":\"ℹ fail 0\"},{\"path\":\"computed:sha256:a743b65afaef26961a61def7ba50c55dbe83330eb27aa852fb7a13052fc3ceb6:/records/constructionEdges/0\",\"quote\":\"\\\"value\\\":\\\"false\\\"},\\\"declaresPredecessor\\\"\"},{\"path\":\"computed:sha256:a743b65afaef26961a61def7ba50c55dbe83330eb27aa852fb7a13052fc3ceb6:/records/comparison\",\"quote\":\"\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"true\\\"},\\\"recordPath\\\":\\\"/records/comparison\\\"\"},{\"path\":\"oracle://odd-glc/program-construction/091ca27cb92d7e80422272f1b0d71d5ae7fd7dfc299d037dfef1c71b1b924e99\",\"quote\":\"Counts and file presence alone are not semantic acceptance\"},{\"path\":\".abiogenesis/workspace-manifest.json\",\"quote\":\"\\\"authorityMode\\\":\\\"clean\\\"\"}]},{\"criterionRef\":\"criterion://odd-glc/generic-lifecycle/evidence/independent-oracle@5\",\"disposition\":\"indeterminate\",\"rationale\":\"I compared the oracle's single case, its floor, its artifacts and its roles against the actual observations and bodies. They match on: export helloWorld, module src/hello.mjs at protected digest e62ab9f3…, which equals the current bytes and the command-4 digest; observedValue \\\"Hello, world!\\\", which equals the declaration and the plan assertedValue; a pass count of 2 against minimumTestPasses 2; distinct component and UAT roles, each passing separately; and all eight required artifacts present at matching digests. Two things prevent a satisfied verdict. First, the case requires arguments:[], but the predicate observation lacks the raw argument-list and type fields. noArguments comes from source review plus the helper's module_export_return_exact rule, and type comes from typeof the observed value, so strict raw-field compliance cannot be confirmed without an owner disposition. Second, the oracle requires plan satisfaction, but none of the 13 admitted predicates observes expectedStdoutMatch, planSatisfied, executionStatus or a stdout digest. My only basis is reading the retained command-1 body, which contains 'fail 0'; that is not an admitted observation. The Node version used by the planned node --test run is also not stated in its stdout. No wrong identity was found.\",\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"oracle://odd-glc/program-construction/091ca27cb92d7e80422272f1b0d71d5ae7fd7dfc299d037dfef1c71b1b924e99\",\"quote\":\"\\\"cases\\\":[{\\\"arguments\\\":[],\\\"exportName\\\":\\\"helloWorld\\\",\\\"modulePath\\\":\\\"src/hello.mjs\\\",\\\"observationKind\\\":\\\"module_return\\\",\\\"returnValue\\\":\\\"Hello, world!\\\"}]\"},{\"path\":\"oracle://odd-glc/program-construction/091ca27cb92d7e80422272f1b0d71d5ae7fd7dfc299d037dfef1c71b1b924e99\",\"quote\":\"admitted worker execution of the original node:test plan, its pass floor, zero failures and plan satisfaction\"},{\"path\":\"computed:sha256:a743b65afaef26961a61def7ba50c55dbe83330eb27aa852fb7a13052fc3ceb6:/records/comparison\",\"quote\":\"\\\"basis\\\":\\\"reviewed module source and implementation/worksite_command_helper.ts module_export_return_exact: callable exported() without arguments; non-callable exports also permitted\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"true\\\"\"},{\"path\":\"computed:sha256:a743b65afaef26961a61def7ba50c55dbe83330eb27aa852fb7a13052fc3ceb6:/records/comparison\",\"quote\":\"\\\"type\\\":{\\\"basis\\\":\\\"typeof actual observedValue (null and array distinguished); not a raw observation field\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"string\\\"}\"},{\"path\":\"computed:sha256:a743b65afaef26961a61def7ba50c55dbe83330eb27aa852fb7a13052fc3ceb6:/records/constructionEdges/12\",\"quote\":\"\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"true\\\"},\\\"recordPath\\\":\\\"/records/constructionEdges/12\\\"\"},{\"path\":\"command-1.stdout\",\"quote\":\"ℹ pass 2\"},{\"path\":\"command-4.stdout\",\"quote\":\"digest test-execution-plan.json sha256:c69ed6ca8f50ba55e59ff4a841856cb977a63ebdf6d2c98b81e35ba62af4ed7d\"},{\"path\":\"command-7.stdout\",\"quote\":\"ok verifiers-distinct\"},{\"path\":\"src/hello.mjs\",\"quote\":\"export function helloWorld() {\"},{\"path\":\"test/component/hello.test.mjs\",\"quote\":\"assert.strictEqual(helloWorld(), \\\"Hello, world!\\\");\"},{\"path\":\"test-execution-plan.json\",\"quote\":\"\\\"expectedStdoutMatch\\\": \\\"fail 0\\\",\"},{\"path\":\"original-js-sdlc-bootstrap-declaration.txt\",\"quote\":\"expectedTestPassCount must be at least 2, matching the admitted component and UAT coverage floor.\"}]}],\"residuals\":[{\"scope\":\"selected-assessment\",\"criterionRef\":\"criterion://odd-glc/generic-lifecycle/evidence/independent-oracle@5\",\"description\":\"The retained comparison lacks the raw argument-list and raw type fields. The oracle's arguments:[] and the string type are derived from source review, the helper rule and typeof, not observed raw. Strict raw-field compliance needs an owner disposition.\"},{\"scope\":\"selected-assessment\",\"criterionRef\":\"criterion://odd-glc/generic-lifecycle/evidence/independent-oracle@5\",\"description\":\"No admitted predicate observes expectedStdoutMatch, planSatisfied, executionStatus or a stdout digest, which the oracle's plan-satisfaction requirement and the original result stage need (req-pressure:04). Only the retained command-1 body shows 'fail 0'. The Node version of the planned node --test run is not observed in its stdout.\"},{\"scope\":\"outside-assessment\",\"criterionRef\":null,\"description\":\"The original task remains open. Acceptance of the observed execution result (bindings 10/11) requires a separate owner/Executive conjunction. Every carried evaluate/assess duty, including computed-records and the 3455…/assess, remains missing or pending.\"},{\"scope\":\"outside-assessment\",\"criterionRef\":null,\"description\":\"Whether the retained execution is current is for the owner to decide. Current bytes equal the command-4 and comparison digests, and the construction changed nothing. The author did not check or rerun C2.\"},{\"scope\":\"outside-assessment\",\"criterionRef\":\"criterion://odd-glc/generic-lifecycle/evidence/modality-and-conflicts@5\",\"description\":\"These source pressures are still unresolved: what executeFromPlan:false means (req-pressure:15); whether the conformance document's ABG vocabulary is current (req-pressure:12); 'artifact summaries' versus full content as the evidence source (req-pressure:03); and the unnamed acceptor for the accept rule. The witness run and parityRule are unverified historical source, not evidence of legacy traversal parity.\"},{\"scope\":\"outside-assessment\",\"criterionRef\":\"criterion://odd-glc/generic-lifecycle/evidence/obligation-conservation@5\",\"description\":\"helloWorld() behaviour with arguments, other exports and side effects are unspecified by the source and unproved (req-pressure:07). Neither test has an admitted negative or mutation outcome; strict equality is judged adequate here but no kill truth exists. The document checks (command-6) are only structural presence checks.\"},{\"scope\":\"outside-assessment\",\"criterionRef\":\"criterion://odd-glc/generic-lifecycle/evidence/obligation-conservation@5\",\"description\":\"Edges 1, 6 and 10 record declaresPredecessor=false, and all 14 edges record completeReport=false. package.json cannot carry derivedFrom and the test comments omit package.json. The conformance document counts package.json and src/hello.mjs as one 'source' surface, while the design lists them separately. The earlier retained notes construction-basis-not-admitted and derivation-order-not-observable are preserved at their own scope.\"},{\"scope\":\"outside-assessment\",\"criterionRef\":\"criterion://odd-glc/generic-lifecycle/evidence/source-faithfulness@5\",\"description\":\"The test design fixes exactly one test per file. This forecloses the depth coverage the source anticipates but does not require. The plan still keeps a floor and pins no pass count, so there is no conflict; it is recorded as a design narrowing.\"}]}","ttft_ms":9500,"type":"result","duration_ms":276803,"uuid":"c59939d3-8c9b-4b89-8fb3-0d5fa685b7df","ttft_stream_ms":8776,"time_to_request_ms":2616,"first_content_frame_ms":8777,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
